
  NetRewind appliance

  This box is recording what changes on the segment it is plugged into.

    netrewind timeline --last 15m       what happened, narrated
    netrewind incidents --last 24h      what it concluded, and on what evidence
    netrewind events --family system    whether it has had any blind spots
    netrewind serve --addr 0.0.0.0:8464 read it in a browser

  The record is at /var/lib/netrewind/events.db. Configuration is
  /etc/netrewind/netrewindd.yaml; run `netrewindd --check-config` after
  editing it, and `rc-service netrewindd restart` to apply it.

  There is no sshd. The console is the only way in, which is deliberate for a
  box whose job is to watch a network it does not trust.

